# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT CONFIGURATION (Turso Serverless SQLite)
# For the local demo, FLOW uses the included SQLite file (file:./dev.db).
# Vercel serverless cannot persist local SQLite writes.
# To deploy to Vercel, you must use a hosted database like Turso.
#
# Create a Turso database, and set these environment variables in your Vercel Project Settings:

DATABASE_URL="libsql://your-db-name.turso.io"
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN="your-turso-auth-token"

# Locally, DO NOT set these if you want to use the local dev.db file for testing.
